<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $66-7/8 (FIM 318.50).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $66-7/8 (FIM 318.50).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $1-7/8 at $66-7/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 318.50 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed up 8.10 at a new year high 315.10.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/4 at $34 on Wall Street. The price equals about 81.00 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.90 markka at 80.10.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Monday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 1.10 markka at 95.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
